(This project extends our Project 4.1 Erlang/OTP Reddit engine with a JSON REST API and) Tj
T*
(independent Erlang CLI clients. The optional bonus registers public keys, signs every post,) Tj
T*
(and verifies post integrity both at the server and on clients.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Implementation uses OTP libraries only: inets HTTP server/client, built-in JSON,) Tj
T*
(gen_server/supervisor, public_key, and crypto. Python standard-library scripts generate this) Tj
T*
(PDF and the submission ZIP archives; they are not part of the engine or client runtime.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Deliverables: project4.zip, project4-bonus.zip, and this separate report.pdf. The group must) Tj
T*
(add the actual main and bonus MP4 recordings and replace pending links before final) Tj
T*
(submission.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Due date supplied in the assignment: December 13 at midnight. The group should use the exact) Tj
T*
(deadline shown in Canvas.) Tj
