BT
/F2 13 Tf
48 751 Td
(REST interface and behavior) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
12 TL
48 725 Td
(All application endpoints use /api/v1. Requests/responses are JSON. Success has data and) Tj
T*
(request_id fields; failure has error and request_id. Created objects return data.id. Lists) Tj
T*
(use data.posts, data.comments, or data.messages.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POST /users registers username and, for bonus mode, a PEM public_key. GET /users/:name/karma) Tj
T*
(returns received vote total. PUT /users/:name/online updates only the caller. GET) Tj
T*
(/users/:name/public-key returns the registered key.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GET/POST /subreddits lists/creates communities. PUT/DELETE /subreddits/:name/subscription) Tj
T*
(joins/leaves. Creating a community also joins its creator.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POST /posts creates text posts or reposts with community, text, and optional original ID.) Tj
T*
(GET /posts/:id downloads a post. GET/POST /posts/:id/comments reads the thread or adds) Tj
T*
(comments with optional parent ID.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PUT /posts/:id/vote and /comments/:id/vote set direction to -1, 0, or 1. A repeated vote is) Tj
T*
(idempotent; changing direction updates author karma by the delta. Self-votes are forbidden.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GET /feed returns posts in joined communities. GET /search?q=... searches globally visible) Tj
T*
(posts. Feed/search/inbox use descending IDs, optional exclusive before cursor, and limit) Tj
T*
(1-100 \(default 20\). Thread comments return creation order with parent IDs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(POST /messages sends to a recipient, including offline recipients. POST) Tj
T*
(/messages/:id/replies permits only the recipient to reply. GET /inbox returns only the) Tj
T*
(caller's received messages. Reconnect preserves subscriptions and messages.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Statuses: 200 reads/updates; 201 creation; 400 invalid requests/keys/signatures; 403) Tj
T*
(forbidden/offline; 404 missing; 405 unsupported method; 409 duplicate; 422 download) Tj
T*
(integrity failure; 503 engine unavailable; 504 engine timeout.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Names/text must be nonempty UTF-8 after trimming and at most 10,000 bytes. Request bodies) Tj
T*
(are capped at 64 KiB. Malformed JSON, IDs, or limits receive errors without crashing the) Tj
T*
(HTTP service. Mutations are never automatically retried.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The README provides exact methods, JSON fields, CLI commands, curl examples, and response) Tj
T*
(shapes for every resource.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
