BT
/F2 13 Tf
48 751 Td
(Bonus signature design) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
12 TL
48 725 Td
(Client keys use RSA-2048 with public exponent 65537. Signatures use SHA-256 and PKCS#1 v1.5) Tj
T*
(through OTP public_key/crypto. Private keys are generated locally with permissions 0600;) Tj
T*
(only public keys and post signatures cross the REST API.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Registration in bonus mode requires a valid RSA-2048 public key. It is stored with the) Tj
T*
(account and cannot be replaced. Other registered online users retrieve it through GET) Tj
T*
(/users/:name/public-key.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The exact signed bytes are UTF-8 OTP JSON encoding of the fixed ordered array [1, author,) Tj
T*
(community, exact_text, original_id_or_null]. Version and fixed field order avoid map-order) Tj
T*
(ambiguity. Text is not normalized before signing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The posting CLI reads its private PEM, signs locally, and sends a Base64 signature with the) Tj
T*
(post. A repost signs its own author, text, destination community, and source ID.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The engine verifies the signature before creating the post and stores post/signature) Tj
T*
(atomically. Bonus mode rejects unsigned and invalidly signed posts. Base mode preserves the) Tj
T*
(original unsigned behavior.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Every post returned through detail, feed, or search is checked on the server. A failure) Tj
T*
(produces HTTP 422. The bonus CLI separately fetches each author's public key over HTTP,) Tj
T*
(checks each returned post, and prints SIGNATURE verified or fails.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Server ID and mutable score are excluded from the signed payload; voting therefore preserves) Tj
T*
(content signatures. The signed fields protect content integrity relative to the server-) Tj
T*
(provided key. They do not authenticate unsigned operations, provide key certification, or) Tj
T*
(prevent replay.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Bonus demo: keygen local key directories; start server --mode bonus; register each public) Tj
T*
(PEM; post with --key PRIVATE_PEM; read with --bonus and observe key lookup and verification.) Tj
T*
(See the video guide for complete commands.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
