ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
12 TL
48 725 Td
(Base regression and HTTP suite: 13 tests passed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Bonus suite: Passed \(crypto, engine, HTTP, and independent client checks\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Base multi-process demo: PASS; 27 independent client OS process IDs recorded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Bonus multi-process demo: PASS; 28 independent client OS process IDs recorded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Both extracted archives passed build, applicable tests, and independent-client demos.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Evidence is preserved in evidence/base-tests.log, bonus-tests.log, base-demo.log, and bonus-) Tj
T*
(demo.log. These are actual executions, not expected-output examples.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Base checks cover registration, membership, nested comments, reposts, vote/karma updates,) Tj
T*
(pagination, private inboxes, replies, offline delivery, search, malformed input, engine) Tj
T*
(timeout \(504\), and unavailable engine \(503\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Bonus checks cover wrong/malformed keys, invalid/missing signatures, changes to all signed) Tj
T*
(fields, valid reposts, score changes, server-side tampering on detail/feed/search, and) Tj
T*
(independent client rejection of changed downloaded text. Test-only OTP state replacement) Tj
T*
(injects corruption; no corruption endpoint is exposed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The local OTP 29.1.2 installation initially lacked crypto. Validation used a locally built) Tj
T*
(OTP crypto application linked against OpenSSL 3.5.4 in an excluded build/runtime overlay.) Tj
T*
(Submitted sources require a complete OTP installation and contain no native binaries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Limits: in-memory data, single serialized engine bottleneck, trusted identities, no) Tj
T*
(TLS/persistence, no replay prevention/key rotation, and no signatures on comments/messages.) Tj
T*
(Public-key lookup trusts the server; there is no PKI. This submission makes no new) Tj
T*
(performance-capacity claims.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recording and YouTube upload remain group tasks. Add videos/main.mp4 and videos/bonus.mp4,) Tj
T*
(enter real links in config/submission.json, regenerate the report, and run package --final.) Tj
T*
(Final packaging rejects missing video files or links.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
